WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.131
This is the full Contoso Health demo on Azure Kubernetes Service,

00:00:03.181 --> 00:00:04.698
in the Indonesia Central region.

00:00:04.748 --> 00:00:08.760
In ten steps we prepare the subscription and a deployment identity without secrets,

00:00:08.810 --> 00:00:11.207
connect GitHub, provision the platform with Bicep,

00:00:11.257 --> 00:00:14.340
ship the app through pull requests, watch it with Azure Monitor,

00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:17.276
prove the Azure Policy guardrails, and finish with clean-up.

00:00:17.326 --> 00:00:19.821
Steps two to four were recorded in the Azure portal;

00:00:19.871 --> 00:00:21.975
the other steps show the real automated run.

00:00:22.025 --> 00:00:23.590
All data in the app is synthetic.
